{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.poster.avif?t=1758034951\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.webm?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.mp4?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELARIENNE: Strategy decides the battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One summon can change the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable variables form your army, and only precise strategy carries you to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All unit summons are random, from common tiers to ultra-rare ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 tiers in total, and 3 races: human, elf, and orc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race has a completely different combat style, making every team build fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to create your dream lineup? It\u2019s your choices and strategy that overcome uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world consumed by darkness, it is your judgment that will protect <strong>ELARIENNE</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/3f9b353cd8187be3f302c8e3d5011264.poster.avif?t=1758034951\" width=640 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/3f9b353cd8187be3f302c8e3d5011264.webm?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/3f9b353cd8187be3f302c8e3d5011264.mp4?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Runes: Luck or Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What matters more\u2014luck or strategy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Epic bosses to choose from three random runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune gives you another chance to shape your strategy\u2014or roll the dice again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.poster.avif?t=1758034951\" width=640 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.webm?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/9a74106385fb79ae05e116d7a6a74a61.mp4?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive 150 Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear in waves and follow a fixed looping path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t defeat them, they stay on the field and stack with future waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let 70 enemies build up on the map, or fail to kill a boss before time runs out, and your run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When too many monsters gather, the darkness consumes ELARIENNE and the world falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.poster.avif?t=1758034951\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.webm?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/8147762bf095c71961d649072222fff4.mp4?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Yet Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The units you summon shape how you choose runes and upgrades\u2014turning randomness into strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will luck be on your side? Or will you fall to the darkness?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Triumph","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/14d5f5b177e5f35d7291300e6ed3f64b42d31b6d.jpg"},{"name":"The First Trial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/34110c18844af66c6c69a3682c1b05850bb91bc4.jpg"},{"name":"Heir of Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/8a662b5c75276ff1bd8db10053f249f5b69b4941.jpg"},{"name":"The Fallen Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/aaa10fa1fa73588d2b4af424a1dd27db3b40d665.jpg"},{"name":"With the Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/dd3229f5103a864765d29c004fd62c307e255c6f.jpg"},{"name":"Gatekeeper of Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/697fc9352ad20612cd1bbebee526488e8e460cb7.jpg"},{"name":"Moment of Reckoning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/73bb2429c36788a406aac5cd71900e3d26c750d7.jpg"},{"name":"Last Line of Defense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/fd719fd60b33840d21e37e99b47b592a4a01366c.jpg"},{"name":"Judgment of the Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/440ad91552b25dc5ad614b8b0d20f3568336264c.jpg"},{"name":"Final Confrontation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304340/5a7342ceb316d29fdf41396ca1a9bf859029e788.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304340?t=1758034951","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304340?t=1758034951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/4d3a4476f5630bbc190d13ecaa0a565ac68bf55d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758034951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/4d3a4476f5630bbc190d13ecaa0a565ac68bf55d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758034951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.poster.avif?t=1758034951\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f11856ee1733da6469fecd7bcd.webm?t=1758034951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304340/extras/cc4921f1